ved_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-09-02T20:41:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T15:31:09Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T15:30:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-07T15:30:55Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFreeType outline coordinates are encoded using the 26.6 fixed-point format, where the fractional part is encoded on 6 bits, i.e. 64 parts, not 60. Our MSDF shapes were 6.67% larger than the actual font metrics.\r\n\r\n- Fixes #118293.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nFixing this bug will change the metrics for MSDF text in user projects, which may be seen as breaking as it might shuffle some glyphs or parts of UI around.\r\n\r\nSo we should consider whether this is fine to simply document, or if we should add a font import option to keep using the wrong divisor for compatibility.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* A compatibility setting was added as `gui/fonts/compatibility/msdf_legacy_scaling` (opt-in) so that projects upgrading to 4.8 who need to ensure their MSDF fonts don't change metric can enable that.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nProject: [font.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31809690/font.zip)\r\n\r\n|Master, MSDF disabled|Master, MSDF enabled|PR, MSDF enabled|\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| <img width=\"1217\" height=\"825\" alt=\"msdf-01-master-msdf_disabled\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d21bb6b-8dec-4314-b61c-23df37856cb8\" /> | <img width=\"1206\" height=\"816\" alt=\"msdf-02-master-msdf_enabled\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a88055c3-d6fb-40fe-a9ab-733e99429b91\" /> |<img width=\"1204\" height=\"820\" alt=\"msdf-03-scale_fix-msdf-enabled\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4603d03e-332b-46da-8349-4c6b5ace5120\" /> |\r\n\r\nWhile this PR fixes the relative glyph size, you can see from the rulers that the positioning is still a bit different in this case, and there's an inconsistent baseline (that part is #121369 which will be addressed in another PR).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https:/